      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That's an insightful observation. Phrases such as \"as we move forward,\" \"at this time,\" and \"it is important to remember\" do indeed serve more than rhetorical purposes; they can function as linguistic pivots to create a sense of continuity and inevitability. By embedding these phrases frequently, individuals using them are subtly setting up a narrative where progression seems organic, leaving little space for dissent or alternative perspectives. They're crafting an auditory experience that conditions listeners to accept changes as part of a natural march, often diminishing the option or need to question those changes critically.",
